{"version":1,"key":"card:185","content":{"id":185,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"610866d4-b050-4c92-bfa4-3239058062cc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们一般是通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dx"},{"type":"formatted","text":", "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dy"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来控制图形的平移，其中 dx 控制在水平方向上的平移，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"dy"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 控制在垂直方向上的平移"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"efd5708a-82ea-49bb-9e7d-b6c341c39f5f","collabId":"687c2125-b836-42c7-9d6d-a3a75fdf5acd","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"// 水平方向向右移动 100，垂直方向向下平移 50\nctx.transform(1, 0, 0, 1, 100, 50)\nctx.fillRect(50, 50, 100, 50)"},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"collabId":"006c5cb3-3e62-41c5-9e11-ee13398d92dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Canvas 提供了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"translate(dx, dy)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来做平移变换，上面的变换可以写为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"56c0ec0a-7310-4872-bf5c-9be06ba6be18","collabId":"f60c2003-9cde-4674-bded-d10e4c5ff5c5","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"ctx.translate(100, 50)"}],"tags":["Canvas/变换"],"createTime":1690383818048,"updateTime":1791903937114,"linkedCards":[{"id":183,"target":{"key":"card:183","type":"card","id":183},"summary":"在很多时候我们需要对绘制的对象进行拉伸，旋转，平移等操作，这些操作可以看做是对坐标进行了变换，在数学上的处理是对当前坐标乘以一个矩阵得到一个新的坐标，然后将新坐标表示的点绘制在画布上 其中等式左边是变换矩阵与当前坐标，右边为变换后的坐标。 ...","tags":["Canvas/变换"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1791903937114}}